    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald McDermott are delighted to present to the market this beautiful three bedroom family residence in this mature estate located within Athy Town. This magnificent property is in turn key condition. No. 47 White Castle Lawn offers spacious living accommodation with Sitting Room, Kitchen / Dining Area, Downstairs Bathroom, 3 Bedrooms and Upstairs Toilet. Property also boasts spacious parking to front with wide side entrance.White Castle Lawn is a highly sought after estate within walking distance of all town amenities including Athy Train Station & Schools, making it an ideal property for investors or commuters alike. Viewing is highly recommended. Contact us now to arrange a viewing. To see current offers or place an offer on this property, register for your mySherryFitz account at SherryFitz.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance - 5.87 x 2.93\nTimber flooring. Shelving. Radiator. Light fittings x 2.\n\nSitting Room - 3.70 x 4.69\nTimber flooring. Feature fireplace with marble surround & solid fuel stove inset. Radiator. Curtains.\n\nGuest W.C. / Bathroom - 2.01 x 2.77\nTiled floor. Partially tiled walls. W.C. W.H.B. Bath. Wooden wall penelling. Radiator. Vent. Light fitting.\n\nKitchen / Dining Area - 6.55 x 4.54\nTimber flooring. Fitted kitchen units. Cooker. Wall unit. Fitted unit. French doors to rear garden.\n\nLanding - 4.09 x 1.55\nCarpet on stairs and landing. Staighre to attic. Light fitting. Access to eaves.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.57 x 2.93\nCarpet. Velux window. Light fitting. Radiator.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.57 x 2.89\nCarpet. Velux window. Light fitting. Access to eaves. Radiator.\n\nBedroom 3 - 1.90 x 3.27\nCarpet. Light fitting. Radiator. Curtains. Vent.\n\nBathroom 2 - 2.04 x 1.03\nTiled floor. Tiled splash back. W.C. W.H.B & unit. Curtain nets. Shelving. Light fitting. Radiator.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Oil central heating.</li><li>Barna shed.</li><li>Rain water collector.</li><li>Spacious driveway.</li><li>Composite front door. </li><li>Not overlooked.</ul>"
      },
